{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":21,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於巴比倫的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於海邊沙漠",{"noteId":10},"的預言：",{"text":"敵人從可怕的沙漠之地上來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像狂風掃過南部的曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見一個可怖的異象：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「詭詐的在行詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅的在行毀滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以攔人啊，攻打吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪代人啊，圍城吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必終止巴比倫帶來的痛苦。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這使我充滿痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我陷入劇痛中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同分娩的婦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因聽見的話而驚慌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因看見的景象而害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心慌意亂，驚懼不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我期盼的黃昏卻令我恐懼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們擺設宴席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鋪開地毯又吃又喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領啊，起來擦亮盾牌備戰吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你去派人守望，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他報告所看見的情況。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他看到戰車、一對對的騎兵、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驢隊和駱駝隊的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要提高警惕，密切察看。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望的人大喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「主啊，我終日站在瞭望塔上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整夜守在自己的崗位上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，戰車和一對對的騎兵來了。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他又接著說：「巴比倫傾倒了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傾倒了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它所有的神像都被打碎在地上。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，我說：「我的百姓啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們像場上被碾、被篩的穀物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我把從以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華那裡聽見的都告訴你們了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["關於以東的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"以下是關於度瑪的預言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人從西珥大聲問道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「守望者啊，黑夜還有多長？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望者啊，黑夜還有多長？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望者回答：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「黎明將到，但黑夜會再來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們想問就問吧，可以再回來。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["關於阿拉伯的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"以下是關於阿拉伯的預言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底但的商隊必宿在阿拉伯的樹林中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提瑪的居民啊，要送水給這些口渴的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿食物給這些逃難的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們逃離了刀光箭影和激烈的戰爭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["主對我說：「按雇工規定的做工年限，一年之內，基達所有的榮耀必消失，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["勇敢的弓箭手必所剩無幾。這是以色列的上帝耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"「海邊沙漠」指巴比倫。","reference":{"chapter":21,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/21.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/22.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/20.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}